*HEADING
True-3D simplified catwalk from S10 V2.0 APDL; units N / mm / tonne / s
** X=longitudinal (chainage-K16+876, mm), Y=transverse, Z=up
** R1-R7 contract; 8 merged rope lines (2 catwalks x 2 bands x bearing/gantry)
** BOUNDARY: UX/UY/UZ only at S10-mapped support nodes (anchors / downpull).
** HARD LOCK: do NOT restrain UY on NALL. All-mesh UY=0 is the 2-D MCT migrate
** pattern and is forbidden on this deck. Lateral (L) modes must remain free.
** COARSEN=4  MODES=100  TYPE=B31 SECTION=RECT  IC=8-IP global PK2
